<title>UK: Euromarket turnover rose in week to Sept 12 - ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover rose in week to Sept 12 - ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets rose to $955.50 billion in the week to September 12 from $910.33 billion the previous week, International Securities Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					 Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		    44.38		32.42</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    17.46		18.30</p>
<p> Secondary market:		 911.09	     877.91</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues   164.04	     137.36</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear     700.87	     659.32</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	   254.62	     251.01</p>
</text>
